.Dd 2026-05-31
.Dt NOMAD-BACKEND 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nomad-backend
.Nd show or switch the AI inference backend
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm nomad backend
.Op Cm show | ollama | omlx
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
inspects or changes the AI inference backend used by the NOMAD stack.
The active backend is stored as
.Ev NOMAD_AI_BACKEND
in
.Pa ~/.config/project-nomad/.env
and is read at startup.
.Pp
NOMAD supports two backends:
.Bl -tag -width "ollama"
.It Cm ollama
Runs Ollama natively (Metal-accelerated on Apple Silicon, Rosetta-emulated
on Intel).
Works on any supported Mac running macOS 14 or later.
.It Cm omlx
Runs Apple's MLX inference stack.
Delivers higher throughput on Apple Silicon.
Requires Apple Silicon and macOS 15 (Sequoia) or later.
.El
.Pp
Switching backends tears down every active AI LaunchAgent and kills any
orphan inference processes before bringing up the target stack.
The admin layer (a container) continues to reach inference at
.Li host.docker.internal:11434
regardless of which backend is active.
Models on disk are preserved both ways: MLX weights
.Pq Pa ${NOMAD_DATA_ROOT}/mlx-models
and Ollama weights
.Pq Pa ${NOMAD_DATA_ROOT}/ollama-models
coexist, so switching back does not trigger a re-download.
.Pp
The backend is not written to
.Pa .env
until the new stack is fully running.
A mid-switch failure therefore leaves the recorded backend unchanged rather
than claiming a backend that is not actually serving.
.Sh oMLX PROCESS TOPOLOGY
Under the oMLX backend, three processes run simultaneously:
.Bl -tag -width "embed-only Ollama"
.It oMLX server
Listens on
.Li 127.0.0.1:8000
and serves Apple MLX model inference.
Model weights are stored on the data drive under
.Pa ${NOMAD_DATA_ROOT}/mlx-models .
.It Ollama-compat proxy
Listens on
.Li 0.0.0.0:11434
\(em the same bind the native Ollama agent uses, so the admin container reaches it
via
.Li host.docker.internal:11434
unchanged \(em and translates the Ollama API into oMLX requests forwarded to the
loopback oMLX server on
.Li :8000 .
No admin configuration changes are required when switching backends.
.It Embed-only Ollama
Listens on
.Li 127.0.0.1:11435
and serves only embedding requests (nomic-embed-text).
Its model weights are stored on the internal disk at
.Pa ~/.config/project-nomad/embed-models
so that RAG embeddings survive a data-drive unplug.
Because the same weights serve both backends, Qdrant vector indices built
under Ollama remain valid under oMLX and vice versa; no reindex is required
when switching.
.El
.Pp
Under the plain Ollama backend, only native Ollama runs, listening on
.Li 0.0.0.0:11434 .
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Cm show
Print the currently active backend
.Pq e.g.\& Sq ollama No or Sq omlx .
This is the default when no argument is given.
.It Cm ollama
Switch to the Ollama backend.
Works on any supported Mac (Intel or Apple Silicon, macOS 14 or later).
.It Cm omlx
Switch to the oMLX (Apple MLX) backend.
Requires Apple Silicon and macOS 15 or later.
The command aborts with an error if the host does not meet these
requirements.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width "NOMAD_DATA_ROOT"
.It Ev NOMAD_AI_BACKEND
Set to
.Cm ollama
or
.Cm omlx
in
.Pa ~/.config/project-nomad/.env .
Read at every
.Nm nomad
invocation.
Updated by a successful backend switch.
.It Ev NOMAD_DATA_ROOT
Root for cold content (models, ZIMs, etc.).
MLX weights and Ollama weights are both stored here and preserved across
backend switches.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "~/.config/project-nomad/embed-models/"
.It Pa ~/.config/project-nomad/.env
Generated secrets file.
Contains
.Ev NOMAD_AI_BACKEND .
.It Pa ${NOMAD_DATA_ROOT}/mlx-models/
MLX model weights (oMLX backend).
.It Pa ${NOMAD_DATA_ROOT}/ollama-models/
Ollama model weights (Ollama backend).
.It Pa ~/.config/project-nomad/embed-models/
Internal-disk store for the embed-only Ollama used by oMLX for RAG
embeddings.
Kept on internal storage so it survives a data-drive unplug.
.It Pa ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.projectnomad.omlx.plist
oMLX server LaunchAgent (port 8000).
.It Pa ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.projectnomad.ollama-proxy.plist
Ollama-compat proxy LaunchAgent (port 11434, oMLX backend only).
.It Pa ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.projectnomad.ollama-embed.plist
Embed-only Ollama LaunchAgent (port 11435, oMLX backend only).
.It Pa ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.projectnomad.ollama.plist
Native Ollama LaunchAgent (port 11434, Ollama backend).
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic nomad backend
Print the active backend.
.It Ic nomad backend omlx
Switch to the oMLX backend on an eligible Apple Silicon Mac.
.It Ic nomad backend ollama
Switch back to the Ollama backend.
.It Ic nomad check stack
Confirm all processes are healthy after a switch.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr nomad 1 ,
.Xr nomad-check 1 ,
.Xr nomad-install 1 ,
.Xr nomad-models 1 ,
.Xr nomad-reset-ollama 1
